se of Lactobacillus rhamnosus GG capsule following their surgery while in the hospital until discharge.\n\nLactobacillus rhamnosus GG (LGG) Probiotic: Lactobacillus rhanmosus GG(LGG®)(Culturelle) is an over the counter dietary supplement that can help to restore the balance in the gut by promoting colonization to support better digestion and immune health.","deathsNumAffected":0,"deathsNumAtRisk":53,"seriousNumAffected":0,"seriousNumAtRisk":53,"otherNumAffected":0,"otherNumAtRisk":53},{"id":"EG001","title":"Placebo Control Group","description":"Patients in the placebo group will receive a placebo capsule following their surgery while in the hospital until discharge.\n\nPlacebo: Placebo","deathsNumAffected":0,"deathsNumAtRisk":40,"seriousNumAffected":0,"seriousNumAtRisk":40,"otherNumAffected":0,"otherNumAtRisk":40}]},"moreInfoModule":{"limitationsAndCaveats":{"description":"1\\. Data was pulled from documentation in the electronic medical record with the potential for missing documentation."},"certainAgreement":{"piSponsorEmployee":true},"pointOfContact":{"title":"Dr. Mayra Garcia, DNP, APRN, PCNS-BC, EBP-C","organization":"Children's Health Children's Medical Center","email":"Mayra.Garcia@childrens.com","phone":"12144567990"}}},"documentSection":{"largeDocumentModule":{"largeDocs":[{"typeAbbrev":"Prot_SAP","hasProtocol":true,"hasSap":true,"hasIcf":false,"label":"Study Protocol and Statistical Analysis Plan","date":"2020-12-15","uploadDate":"2021-10-19T13:35","filename":"Prot_SAP_001.pdf","size":196412}]}},"derivedSection":{"miscInfoModule":{"versionHolder":"2026-09-14"},"conditionBrowseModule":{"meshes":[{"id":"D001064","term":"Appendicitis"}],"ancestors":[{"id":"D059413","term":"Intraabdominal Infections"},{"id":"D007239","term":"Infections"},{"id":"D005759","term":"Gastroenteritis"},{"id":"D005767","term":"Gastrointestinal Diseases"},{"id":"D004066","term":"Digestive System Diseases"},{"id":"D002429","term":"Cecal Diseases"},{"id":"D007410","term":"Intestinal Dise